'''Ranma Cat (M)''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by beating any stage in [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event#Rumble in the Tendo Dojo|Rumble in the Tendo Dojo]] during the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 604
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Ranma Cat (M)
|name2 = Ranma Cat (F)
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Ranma Cat (F)''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit, like [[Akane Cat (Rare Cat)|Akane Cat]], has too low stats and range to be useful outside of early-game. Its only usable stats are at level 30 and above, and by that point you should invest in more powerful cats such as [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], in which you will get much more usage from than either form of Ranma Cat.

